profile forge.world.core.v1

; REFUSABLE DIVERGENCE — a claim that names a target the world does not have is Rejected(unknown_spinner)
; by name, with a receipt; the world's own seal is what the receiver recomputes.
[pulser:rd_clock](every 1){sig_out}
[spinner:rd_real](w=16, n=8, rotor=quarter_turn_z, configurable){sig_in, socket}
[orb:rd_view]{pose}

[rd_clock] --sig--> [rd_real]
[rd_real] --socket--> [rd_view]
